    "about.p4": "Our mission is simple:",
    "about.p4Bold": "to give a voice to the voiceless.",
    "about.p5": "ZRP Social will always stand as a people's voice against anyone who tries to hold back freedom of speech. We believe that open, honest, and respectful conversation is the foundation of a free society.",
    "about.p5Em": "We are not just another social network – we are a movement. A movement that says",
